# Jetson Vision Suite

A unified, offline-first vision pipeline for NVIDIA Jetson Orin NX supporting:
- **Mode 1**: Open-vocabulary object detection via NanoOWL (TensorRT-optimized OWL-ViT)
- **Mode 2**: Semantic segmentation via DeepStream + TensorRT

Includes a Web UI dashboard, JSON logging, optional Ollama language summarization, and live MJPEG preview.

---

## System Requirements

| Component | Recommended |
|---|---|
| Hardware | NVIDIA Jetson Orin NX 8GB or 16GB |
| JetPack | 5.1.x or 6.0.x (check: `cat /etc/nv_tegra_release`) |
| DeepStream | 6.3 or 6.4 (check: `deepstream-app --version`) |
| Python | 3.10+ |
| CUDA | 11.4+ (JetPack 5.x) or 12.2+ (JetPack 6.x) |
| TensorRT | 8.5+ |
| GStreamer | 1.14+ (included with JetPack) |
| Ollama (optional) | Latest arm64 build |

Check your JetPack version:
```bash
cat /etc/nv_tegra_release
# or
dpkg -l | grep nvidia-jetpack
```

Check DeepStream:
```bash
deepstream-app --version-all
```

