## How to Run

### Quick Start (Web UI)
```bash
./run.sh
# Open browser: http://<jetson-ip>:8080
```

### CLI Examples

**Detection — USB Camera:**
```bash
python3 apps/main.py --mode detect_open_vocab --input camera:0
```

**Detection — RTSP Stream:**
```bash
python3 apps/main.py --mode detect_open_vocab --input "rtsp://192.168.1.100:554/stream"
```

**Detection — Video File:**
```bash
python3 apps/main.py --mode detect_open_vocab --input video:/path/to/video.mp4
```

**Segmentation — USB Camera:**
```bash
python3 apps/main.py --mode segment --input camera:0
```

**Segmentation — RTSP Stream:**
```bash
python3 apps/main.py --mode segment --input "rtsp://192.168.1.100:554/stream"
```

**Segmentation — Video File:**
```bash
python3 apps/main.py --mode segment --input video:/path/to/video.mp4
```

**With Ollama summaries:**
```bash
python3 apps/main.py --mode detect_open_vocab --input camera:0 --enable-ollama
```

**With recording:**
```bash
python3 apps/main.py --mode detect_open_vocab --input camera:0 --record
```

**With custom prompts:**
```bash
python3 apps/main.py --mode detect_open_vocab --input camera:0 \
  --prompt "person, helmet, safety vest, phone"
```

